<p>Jaate Hai Ran Ko Akber A.S Kohraam Mach Gaya Hai.</p>

<p>Baichain Umme Laila (asws) Aur Binte Fatima (asws) Hai</p>

<p>Shabbir A.S Ka Ye Beta Marne Ko Ja Raha Hai</p>

<p>1. Hai Beqaraar Sugra Ayenege Lene Bhayya</p>

<p>Ho Tere Sar Pe Sehra,Armaa'n Hai Mere Bhayya</p>

<p>Akbar Ki Yaad Me Hi Wo Gham Me Mubtela Hai</p>

<p>
2.Izne Weqa Jo Paya Zainab Se Aur Maa Se</p>

<p>Shabbir Sar Jhukaye Kahte the Noujawa Se</p>

<p>Kitna Ghareeb Dekho Aik Baap Hogya Hai</p>

<p>
3.Seene Pa Barchi Khaakar Akber Gire Zamee'n Par</p>

<p>Beta Pukaro Mujhko Kahte the Ran Mai Sarwar</p>

<p>Girte Hai Dhondte Hai Na Koi Aasra Hai</p>

<p>
4.Abbas Ki Judaee Phir Ghum Mila Ye Kaisa </p>

<p>Sab Margaye Hai Mere Mai Hogaya Hoo Tanha</p>

<p>Maqtal Mai Ab Akela Shabbir Hogaya Hai</p>

<p>
5.Wiraan Hogaya Hai Akber Ke Baad Ye Ghar</p>

<p>Zainab Ko Ghush Hai Taari Aur Ro Rahe Hai Sarwar</p>

<p>Maa Baap Ke Liye Ye Kya Saqt Marhala Hai</p>

<p>
6.Sarwar Ke Ladle Ka Karna Hai Humko Matam</p>

<p><b>Ammar Asghari</b> Bhi Girya Kuna Hai Paiham</p>

<p>Kadyal Jawaa'n Ka Lasha qaime Me Araha Hai</p>

<p><center><h1>Kalaam :Askari Hussain(Ammar)</h1></center></p>